cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pladdrr in your research, please cite it as below, and cite Praat itself."
title: "pladdrr: Direct Access to the Core Algorithms of Praat"
abstract: >-
  An object-oriented R interface to the phonetic-analysis algorithms of Praat.
  pladdrr compiles a curated subset of the Praat C++ sources and exposes them
  through Rcpp modules, so Praat's pitch, formant, intensity, spectral,
  cepstral, voice-quality and synthesis routines can be called directly from R
  without an external Praat installation.
